{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他刚得到对方的回应，正处在幸福和心动中，却开始担心这段关系不能一直持续，也害怕对方以后不再需要自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、心动、患得患失、不安、心疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"幸福中渐渐掺入悲伤、刚说出「是」又问「可是呢」、相信过才会怀疑得这么疼，以及脚步踩稳、声音像叹息、胸口下沉的具体画面。右侧关系变化的几条短句也不容易一眼读全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他虽然得到了对方的回应，也想认真对对方好，但越来越害怕对方有一天不再需要自己，甚至连相处的机会也会失去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福、喜欢、珍惜、担忧、患得患失\",\n      \"missed\": \"心愿说出口之后情绪如何逐渐绷紧、幸福与悲伤如何同时存在，以及「相信过，怀疑才这么疼」这一层原因。右侧八条情绪变化需要逐条看才能理清。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正在享受两个人彼此靠近的幸福，却因为太在乎这段关系，开始害怕失去，也不知道该不该继续坦露自己的心意。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"甜蜜、幸福、不舍、焦虑、心疼\",\n      \"missed\": \"从心动不敢说到开始相信彼此需要，再到忽然害怕自己不再被需要的完整变化过程；还有刚确认心意后立即产生怀疑的心理转折，以及音乐反复落下、像叹息一样的细节。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上方标题和下方大号粗体文字形成两个强视觉焦点，且两块都比较长、各自包含多层意思。第一眼能抓到幸福之后的患得患失，以及害怕不再被需要的核心矛盾，两者也能自然串起来；但真正解释这种情绪如何发生、如何变化的关键内容放在中等字号的灰色正文和右侧八条小字里，扫读时容易漏掉。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "96fa2480-33f7-421f-b13c-b8a06596ef25", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003352631006Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:34:51.357680+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "993d3eab52ad1cc66c52e273053b2a491e1674c60026893092c4f2dd2261c488", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T003352631006Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bc19b28f9b8612dfed0989dee805de19b7dbf17d0be1353cb5ac3289c7764c5c"}}}
